Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.90,0:02:07.23,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Eu ainda sou apenas uma criança.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.23,0:02:08.82,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}É o que eu digo a mim mesma.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.82,0:02:10.74,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Mas eu sei que não é exatamente por isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.03,0:02:13.36,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Um dia, todas as desculpas que eu inventei
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:14.82,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}cairão sobre mim.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.24,0:02:17.62,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Eu ainda sou apenas uma criança,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.62,0:02:19.12,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}sentada no meu pequeno quarto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:21.20,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Enquanto peso meu pedaço de felicidade,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.41,0:02:26.88,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}o tempo passa, e logo esqueço o que o encheu de alegria.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.38,0:02:29.80,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Não há um roteiro com falas para ler.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.80,0:02:32.38,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Eu não sei como desempenhar meu papel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:37.72,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}De repente, tudo diante de mim desmoronou.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:40.18,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Eu sei que não estou ouvindo coisas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.31,0:02:42.31,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Não está só na minha cabeça.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.31,0:02:46.73,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Há uma voz que pode curar suavemente minhas feridas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.85,0:02:52.03,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFBAEFF&\blur3}Nós rimos juntas dos nossos erros combinados.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.07,0:02:57.70,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFBAEFF&\blur3}Mesmo que meus desejos escritos sejam desajeitados, é bom acreditar neles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.78,0:03:03.45,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFBAEFF&\blur3}Eu prometi a mim mesma que continuaria, não importa o quão longe ou por quanto tempo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:06.96,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFBAEFF&\blur3}Eu marcharei para o escuro e o desconhecido.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.79,0:03:12.00,OP1 pt-BR,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,300)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFBAEFF&\blur3}É assustador, mas eu sei que um dia...!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 3,0:22:20.07,0:22:24.70,ED-E02 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}te wo suberase shizunda uso wa
Dialogue: 3,0:22:25.07,0:22:29.49,ED-E02 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}mada soko ni ukande kienai
Dialogue: 3,0:22:30.12,0:22:33.62,ED-E02 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}miageta sora wa nigotte
Dialogue: 3,0:22:34.00,0:22:39.46,ED-E02 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}nani ga honto itte
Dialogue: 3,0:22:39.96,0:22:43.72,ED-E02 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}fukaku fukaku soko mukatte
Dialogue: 3,0:22:44.30,0:22:49.56,ED-E02 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}negaigoto sagashi yume mogutta mama
Dialogue: 3,0:22:49.97,0:22:57.56,ED-E02 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}makiagaru doro no naka wo muke motto hayaku
Dialogue: 3,0:22:59.82,0:23:02.32,ED-E02 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}atatakasa dake temochi
Dialogue: 3,0:23:02.32,0:23:04.65,ED-E02 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}sakasa no taiyou mezashi
Dialogue: 3,0:23:04.90,0:23:09.24,ED-E02 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}nakushita kimi no ima ai ni yukou
Dialogue: 3,0:23:09.62,0:23:12.45,ED-E02 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}hanashitara shizuka de
Dialogue: 3,0:23:12.45,0:23:14.62,ED-E02 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}omoide ga sawagashii
Dialogue: 3,0:23:15.00,0:23:19.67,ED-E02 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}imi no nai kotoba ga imi ni nareta
Dialogue: 3,0:23:19.96,0:23:24.63,ED-E02 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}sekai no oku de oboreyou
Dialogue: 3,0:22:20.07,0:22:24.70,ED-E02 pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}As mentiras que deixei escapar afundaram,
Dialogue: 3,0:22:25.07,0:22:29.49,ED-E02 pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}mas ainda flutuam lá no fundo, sem desaparecer.
Dialogue: 3,0:22:30.12,0:22:33.62,ED-E02 pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Olho para o céu e vejo que está nublado,
Dialogue: 3,0:22:34.00,0:22:39.46,ED-E02 pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}alguém pode me dizer o que é real?
Dialogue: 3,0:22:39.96,0:22:43.72,ED-E02 pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Mergulhando mais fundo na água,
Dialogue: 3,0:22:44.30,0:22:49.56,ED-E02 pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}procurando meu pequeno desejo em um vasto mar de sonhos,
Dialogue: 3,0:22:49.97,0:22:57.56,ED-E02 pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}correndo para cavar sob a lama interminável e emaranhada lá embaixo.
Dialogue: 3,0:22:59.82,0:23:02.32,ED-E02 pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Segurando apenas o calor dentro de mim.
Dialogue: 3,0:23:02.32,0:23:04.65,ED-E02 pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Correndo em direção ao reflexo da luz do sol,
Dialogue: 3,0:23:04.90,0:23:09.24,ED-E02 pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}e quando eu chegar lá, talvez eu encontre o tempo que você perdeu.
Dialogue: 3,0:23:09.62,0:23:12.45,ED-E02 pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Quando eu respirar fundo e sentir a calma,
Dialogue: 3,0:23:12.45,0:23:14.62,ED-E02 pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}e lembrar quando você ria comigo.
Dialogue: 3,0:23:15.00,0:23:19.67,ED-E02 pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}O som das nossas conversas vazias ganha um novo significado,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.96,0:23:24.63,ED-E02 pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}mas, lá no fundo, estamos nos afogando.
